      "desc": "An effigy left by Epona of the coven, Druid Ward to the Omen Bear.\n\n\"May my mem'ry weep you silvern tears. And water well the Wevetroots. For a humble life of reverent weeding, is not oft' remembered but always goode.\nRouse my mem'ry from the earth. From will-o-frond, from fair wyrmwort. Lucky I, consumed by roots, for hiding well from royal court.\"",
