      "desc": "An effigy left by Rhiannon of the coven, Fire Mage to Queen Muireall Jotar.\n\n\"May my mem'ry burn by fire, by fury. Settled scores and vying pride. Of a hungry princess I stoked to greatness. Of a long, red strife 'till last I died.\nRouse my mem'ry from the earth. From fungus fire, from Mora's kiss. For last, they found me, drowned me deep. To never sail to rings of 'Dris.\"",
